    "\\brepeat\\b"
  ],
  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Stem is a short kid sentence of four to six words that holds one clear target. Distractors are unrelated actions, not other prefix meanings. Add a concrete picture lemma.",
    "2": "Stem is five to eight words. Distractors are the other two prefix meanings on the same base word, plus one not-plus-base miss.",
    "3": "Stem is seven to ten words. Near-miss choices mix re- and mis- or re- and pre- on the same base, plus one close wrong base."
  },
  "miss_explain": {
